{"id":"431def082fe8ae7d","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-possible-cofinalities.md","title":"Possible Cofinalities","display":"df-possible-cofinalities — Possible Cofinalities","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-possible-cofinalities","aliases":["58-df-possible-cofinalities","Possible Cofinalities"],"display":"df-possible-cofinalities — Possible Cofinalities","depends_on":["[[58-df-pcf]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-possible-cofinalities"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-possible-cofinalities</span><span>Possible Cofinalities</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-possible-cofinalities — Possible Cofinalities"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"58-df-pcf\">58-df-pcf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (正则基数集)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\)</span> (canonical PCF operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"58-df-pcf\">58-df-pcf</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PossibleCofinalities}\">\\(\\operatorname{PossibleCofinalities}\\)</span> (本文件定义的命名别名)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对非空序数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min C\\coloneqq\\iota c\\;(c\\in C\\land\\forall d\\in C\\;(c\\subseteq d))\">\\(\\min C\\coloneqq\\iota c\\;(c\\in C\\land\\forall d\\in C\\;(c\\subseteq d))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 仅在唯一见证存在时取值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\operatorname{Reg}(\\kappa)\">\\(A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\operatorname{Reg}(\\kappa)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|&lt;\\min A\">\\(|A|&lt;\\min A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PossibleCofinalities}\">\\(\\operatorname{PossibleCofinalities}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}\\)</span> 使用同一有效输入域。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}possible\\text{-}cofinalities} \\vdash \\operatorname{PossibleCofinalities}(A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}possible\\text{-}cofinalities} \\vdash \\operatorname{PossibleCofinalities}(A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Possible cofinalities: regular cardinals appearing as true cofinalities of products modulo ultrafilter-dual ideals</li>\n<li>本别名沿用源 pcf 的非空 progressive 输入域；最大元与其他基数界是该域上的另行定理，不由别名本身断言。</li>\n<li>Scales: existence of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-scale in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod \\kappa_i / J^{\\operatorname{bd}}\">\\(\\prod \\kappa_i / J^{\\operatorname{bd}}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa = \\sup \\operatorname{pcf}(\\bar{\\kappa})\">\\(\\kappa = \\sup \\operatorname{pcf}(\\bar{\\kappa})\\)</span></li>\n<li>Bounds: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pp}(\\kappa) &lt; 2^\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{pp}(\\kappa) &lt; 2^\\kappa\\)</span> for singular <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; Jónsson bounds</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Abraham and Magidor, Cardinal Arithmetic</li>\n<li>Shelah, Cardinal Arithmetic</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-pcf","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-pcf]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-pcf","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pcf}(A)$ (canonical PCF operation, see [[58-df-pcf]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PossibleCofinalities}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\min C\\coloneqq\\iota c\\;(c\\in C\\land\\forall d\\in C\\;(c\\subseteq d))","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\operatorname{Reg}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"|A|<\\min A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PossibleCofinalities}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}possible\\text{-}cofinalities} \\vdash \\operatorname{PossibleCofinalities}(A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pcf}(A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod \\kappa_i / J^{\\operatorname{bd}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa = \\sup \\operatorname{pcf}(\\bar{\\kappa})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pp}(\\kappa) < 2^\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1707,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[58-df-possible-cofinalities]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-971","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-possible-cofinalities.md|58-df-possible-cofinalities]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["b82cea6742372d50","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}